k6 binaries built from this repository are built with xk6 from the components
below, at the exact versions pinned in extensions.json at the commit they were
built from. SOURCE.md at that commit lists every component with its version,
commit, licence and source link, plus the toolchain and build recipe needed to
rebuild the binary. Each component remains under its own licence.

